#==============================================================================================
#
#   buffers - WebIDL buffer source types: BufferableObjectBase, ArrayBufferView, BufferSource
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/WebIDL/Buffers.cpp (lines 1-156) and Buffers.h (lines 1-95).
#       A BufferableObjectBase wraps a JS TypedArray, DataView or ArrayBuffer. Which of the three
#       it holds, and the visit of it, are ported; the lengths, offsets, the viewed buffer and
#       writing bytes read the JS buffer objects (phase 3).
